# Portfolio website (Next.js): environment variables. Copy to .env.local for local development, or set them in
# Coolify. Never commit real secrets.

# Where the API lives. This is the only API address the website needs.
# The browser never calls it directly: it calls /api/... and /media/... on the website's own address, and the
# Next.js server forwards those calls here. The server also uses it to load the home page data, check the admin
# session and send the contact form.
# In Coolify set it for BUILD and RUNTIME (the forwarding rules are fixed when the site is built).
#   Local development (default when unset): http://localhost:5065
#   Staging:    https://staging-api.adnanbinfarook.com   (or the API container's internal address)
#   Production: https://api.adnanbinfarook.com           (or the API container's internal address)
INTERNAL_API_URL=http://localhost:5065
